WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.413
Curtis's conjecture on spheres, proved.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.175
Which homology classes come from real maps

3
00:00:05.175 --> 00:00:07.351
of spheres? Curtis named a short list.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.644
Any other class would eventually force a pattern the algebra forbids.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.202
Claimed: only the famous classes reach homology.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.744
Not in Lean.
